    "description": "The best way to shop the latest Galaxy Z Fold6, Z Flip6, S24 Ultra, TabS10 Series, Watch Ultra, Watch7, Ring, Buds3 Pro, Buds3 and more. Shop the curated deals, get personalized recommendations, and unlock exclusive offers on Shop Samsung app.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udecd Shop Black Friday deals on transformative tech early\r\nGet $100 off when you spend $1,500 or more on your first Shop Samsung app appliance purchase. Or, get $50 off when you spend $500 or more. Enjoy exclusive, extra savings on select products.\r\n\r\n\u2728The new way to shop \r\nEnjoy a premium shoping experience with seamless interaction, faster and easier navigation, and streamlined account management.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd14 Stay updated on the best deals of the latest Samsung products \r\nReceive personalized notifications to get the best deals on the latest Smartphones, Tablets, Wearables, Appliances, TVs, Monitors and more.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfc5Earn Samsung Rewards and redeem points\r\nLog in with your Samsung account and earn up to 6% reward points with the purchase of select products. Check and redeem your Samsung Rewards points with one click.\r\n \r\n\ud83d\udcb3 Flexible payment options\r\nQuick checkout and pay with flexible options including Apple Pay, PayPal, Amazon Pay, or Pay in 4 installations with Affirm.\r\n  \r\nFree shipping, free return. Safe, contact-free delivery to your door.\r\n\r\nStart Shopping!\r\n\r\nLearn more:\r\nhttps://www.samsung.com/us/apps/shop-samsung-app/",
